 199+ 67F6 13               INC DE
 200+ 67F7 CB 7F            BIT 7, A
 201+ 67F9 20 47            JR NZ, .lbsRleFallback
 202+ 67FB E6 7F            AND $7F
 203+ 67FD 32 5B 68         LD (.lbsWsave), A
