 952+ 6F12              ; ==============================================================================
 953+ 6F12              ; Sprite_Compass_Magic / Sprite_Compass_MagicLasting - 32 bytes raw (16x16 px)
 954+ 6F12              ; ==============================================================================
 955+ 6F12              ; Dos variantes del HUD compass mágico, distinguidas por MagicCompassPermanent:
 956+ 6F12              ;   ID 36 ("magic compass HUD") → Sprite_Compass_Magic        (temporal random pickup)
 957+ 6F12              ;   ID 37 ("compass lasting")   → Sprite_Compass_MagicLasting (permanente post-iglesia)
 958+ 6F12              ; Auto-importados desde bg_sprites.json via tools/import_magic_compass_hud.py
 959+ 6F12              ; (raw, sin CPL'r, formato que espera DrawCompassSprite).
