 473+ 8FA6 CD 52 8F         CALL WipeMonsterSlot
 474+ 8FA9 DD 36 01 00      LD (IX+ENT_TYPE), TYPE_NONE
 475+ 8FAD DD 36 02 00      LD (IX+ENT_STATE), STATE_IDLE
