 683+ A209 C2 CE A2         JP NZ, .peScaredFresh
 684+ A20C
 685+ A20C                  ; Fase de pausa (ScareTimer > SCARE_FLEE_THRESHOLD): quieto mirando lados
 686+ A20C 3A 0E B6         LD A, (ScareTimer)
