1116+ A50C 11 B7 E7         LD DE, SpriteFrameTable
1117+ A50F 19               ADD HL, DE
1118+ A510 5E               LD E, (HL)
1119+ A511 23               INC HL
1120+ A512 56               LD D, (HL)
1121+ A513 ED 53 7E A4      LD (OldSprAddr), DE
1122+ A517 3A 84 8D         LD A, (CurrentPaging)
1123+ A51A E6 F8            AND $F8
1124+ A51C 32 84 8D         LD (CurrentPaging), A
1125+ A51F 01 FD 7F         LD BC, $7FFD
1126+ A522 ED 79            OUT (C), A
1127+ A524 C9               RET
