4215+ B668 73               LD (HL), E
4216+ B669 23               INC HL
4217+ B66A 72               LD (HL), D
4218+ B66B                  ; Incrementar counter
4219+ B66B 3A 7B 5F         LD A, (PendingEraseCount)
