6885+ C56A              .udPost:
6886+ C56A                  ; Stuck check para BFS: comparar POS post-call vs pre-call
6887+ C56A 3A FE 82         LD A, (DeathPrevX)
6888+ C56D DD BE 03         CP (IX+ENT_POSX)
6889+ C570 20 19            JR NZ, .udMoved
6890+ C572 3A FF 82         LD A, (DeathPrevY)
6891+ C575 DD BE 04         CP (IX+ENT_POSY)
6892+ C578 20 11            JR NZ, .udMoved
