7131+ C6CE              ; --- CheckDeathTouchPlayer: AABB completo 24x24 vs player (no margen) ---
7132+ C6CE              ; Si overlap: PlayerHealth=0, erase sprite, despawn.
7133+ C6CE              CheckDeathTouchPlayer:
7134+ C6CE 3A FC 82         LD A, (DeathSpawned)
