7282+ C77F 21 FF 5E         LD HL, DBfsQueue
7283+ C782 22 6B 5F         LD (DBfsQHead), HL
7284+ C785 3A 74 5F         LD A, (DBfsCurCx)
7285+ C788 77               LD (HL), A
7286+ C789 23               INC HL
7287+ C78A 3A 75 5F         LD A, (DBfsCurCy)
7288+ C78D 77               LD (HL), A
