8151+ CCCA
8152+ CCCA                  ; --- Draw nuevo sprite ---
8153+ CCCA E5               PUSH HL
8154+ CCCB DD E1            POP IX
8155+ CCCD 5F               LD E, A
8156+ CCCE 16 38            LD D, GAMEOVER_ANIM_Y
8157+ CCD0 C3 E9 99         JP DrawSprite                   ; tail-call
