2036+ D776 57 D4            DEFW BgGfx_forestkey            ; 1: Forest Key
2037+ D778 92 D4            DEFW BgGfx_ruinskey             ; 2: Ruins Key
2038+ D77A CD D4            DEFW BgGfx_cemeterykey          ; 3: Cemetery Key
2039+ D77C 08 D5            DEFW BgGfx_clock_tower_key      ; 4: ClockTower Key (id 66)
2040+ D77E F3 D7            DEFW BgGfx_church_key           ; 5: Church Key (id 191)
2041+ D780 B8 D7            DEFW BgGfx_town_gate_key        ; 6: TownGate Key (id 186)
