 157+ E418              CheckDebugKeys:
 158+ E418 3E FB            LD A, $FB
 159+ E41A DB FE            IN A, ($FE)
 160+ E41C CB 67            BIT 4, A                ; T key: bit 4 de semi-fila $FBFE (0=pulsada)
 161+ E41E 20 1C            JR NZ, .notPressed
