 205+ E45C              .sNotPressed:
 206+ E45C                  ; --- Tecla D: decrementar DayCycleCount (baja velocidad nasties) ---
 207+ E45C CB 51            BIT 2, C                ; D key: bit 2 (0=pulsada)
 208+ E45E 20 13            JR NZ, .dNotPressed
 209+ E460 3A 97 E4         LD A, (SpeedKeyDebounce)
 210+ E463 B7               OR A
 211+ E464 C0               RET NZ
 212+ E465 3E 01            LD A, 1
 213+ E467 32 97 E4         LD (SpeedKeyDebounce), A
 214+ E46A 21 0D BD         LD HL, DayCycleCount
