 568+ EE20              CheckClockSpeedKeys:
 569+ EE20 3E F7            LD A, $F7
 570+ EE22 DB FE            IN A, ($FE)
 571+ EE24 2F               CPL
 572+ EE25 E6 07            AND $07
 573+ EE27
 574+ EE27 47               LD B, A
 575+ EE28 3A F0 E9         LD A, (ClockDebounce)
 576+ EE2B 4F               LD C, A
 577+ EE2C 78               LD A, B
 578+ EE2D 32 F0 E9         LD (ClockDebounce), A
 579+ EE30 78               LD A, B
 580+ EE31
 581+ EE31 79               LD A, C
 582+ EE32 2F               CPL
 583+ EE33 A0               AND B
 584+ EE34 C8               RET Z
 585+ EE35
 586+ EE35 CB 47            BIT 0, A
 587+ EE37 28 06            JR Z, .try2
 588+ EE39 3E 01            LD A, 1
