 175+ EFE3 CD EB 6D         CALL CancelMagicCompass             ; magic compass normal: cancela al saltar hito
 176+ EFE6 CD 1B 6E         CALL RefreshMagicCompassForNewObjective ; lasting compass: recompute path al nuevo goal
 177+ EFE9 C9               RET
