 872+ F2E1 21 18 58         LD HL, $5800 + COMPASS_CHARROW * $20 + COMPASS_COL
 873+ F2E4 77               LD (HL), A
 874+ F2E5 23               INC HL
 875+ F2E6 77               LD (HL), A
 876+ F2E7 21 38 58         LD HL, $5800 + (COMPASS_CHARROW + 1) * $20 + COMPASS_COL
