 236+ DDCE 30 02            JR NC, .cbtNoOverR
 237+ DDD0 3E FF            LD A, $FF
 238+ DDD2              .cbtNoOverR:
 239+ DDD2 B9               CP C
 240+ DDD3 D8               RET C
 241+ DDD4                  ; --- Vertical AABB (player rect 16x21) ---
 242+ DDD4 3A A1 81         LD A, (EntityTable + ENT_POSY)
 243+ DDD7 4F               LD C, A
