 704+ E084 32 CC 82         LD (BankCutsceneTimer), A
 705+ E087 3E 15            LD A, BCP_HAND_OPEN_OUT
 706+ E089 32 CB 82         LD (BankCutscenePhase), A
 707+ E08C C9               RET
