 497+ EC5D C8               RET Z
 498+ EC5E 2B               DEC HL
 499+ EC5F 22 DA 5F         LD (EspadaTimer), HL
 500+ EC62 C9               RET                                 ; (color via cycler, gates via logic_game)
 501+ EC63
 502+ EC63              ; ==============================================================================
